1
00:00:01,637 --> 00:00:03,594
Ugh.

2
00:00:03,677 --> 00:00:05,497
What should I do?

3
00:00:07,977 --> 00:00:10,097
Should I get dessert?

4
00:00:12,337 --> 00:00:14,077
I'm already pretty full, though.

5
00:00:14,997 --> 00:00:16,656
Still, it looks so good.

6
00:00:19,657 --> 00:00:21,197
How long are you going to debate it?

7
00:00:22,317 --> 00:00:24,877
Just order it. I'll eat half.

8
00:00:26,297 --> 00:00:28,177
You're so sweet, Ueno.

9
00:00:29,357 --> 00:00:30,657
That's what I like about you.

10
00:00:36,037 --> 00:00:37,414
That's why I figured

11
00:00:37,497 --> 00:00:40,197
maybe it could work if
it was with you, Ueno.

12
00:00:41,857 --> 00:00:44,057
Once we started dating, it really hit me.

13
00:00:46,597 --> 00:00:49,057
The way you look at me as a man...

14
00:00:54,917 --> 00:00:57,337
I really can't stand it.

15
00:01:32,009 --> 00:01:33,969
Coming back from time
off kills my motivation.

16
00:01:35,012 --> 00:01:39,154
Time off? You just lounged
around at home, right?

17
00:01:39,237 --> 00:01:42,354
Going out alone is too much effort.

18
00:01:42,437 --> 00:01:45,674
Getting a girlfriend
seems like a hassle, though.

19
00:01:45,757 --> 00:01:48,777
You say that like you could easily get one.

20
00:01:49,857 --> 00:01:51,617
Look who's talking. You're single too.

21
00:01:52,177 --> 00:01:54,497
Anyway, ready yet? You're taking forever.

22
00:01:55,917 --> 00:01:57,217
Your turn.

23
00:01:58,977 --> 00:02:01,121
Nice. Rookie mistake.

24
00:02:01,637 --> 00:02:02,937
Take this!

25
00:02:08,757 --> 00:02:12,377
I spent my break practicing like crazy.

26
00:02:13,884 --> 00:02:16,069
Looks like the more free time you have,

27
00:02:17,554 --> 00:02:18,889
the better you get, huh?

28
00:02:19,431 --> 00:02:21,350
Must be tiring acting tough.

29
00:02:22,477 --> 00:02:23,194
Wanna fight?

30
00:02:23,277 --> 00:02:23,974
Bring it on.

31
00:02:24,057 --> 00:02:24,854
Look me in the eye!

32
00:02:24,937 --> 00:02:27,217
Shut up, Reversi loser.

33
00:02:28,237 --> 00:02:29,354
Oh.

34
00:02:29,437 --> 00:02:31,284
- Good morning.
- Good morning.

35
00:02:37,537 --> 00:02:38,897
Did you do something to upset him?

36
00:02:38,937 --> 00:02:40,536
Nope.

37
00:02:40,619 --> 00:02:41,912
Not at all.

38
00:02:43,917 --> 00:02:45,217
I think.

39
00:02:47,717 --> 00:02:49,257
- Come with me.
- Ow, I'm coming!

40
00:02:51,357 --> 00:02:52,657
Ever since that day,

41
00:02:53,256 --> 00:02:55,400
I've barely spoken to Kanda.

42
00:02:59,513 --> 00:03:00,806
He hasn't come over,

43
00:03:01,537 --> 00:03:03,657
and he hasn't texted to bug me.

44
00:03:07,145 --> 00:03:10,040
Above all, his expense
reports are spotless.

45
00:03:13,037 --> 00:03:15,757
If he could do it right
all along, he should've!

46
00:03:17,997 --> 00:03:19,533
What?

47
00:03:19,616 --> 00:03:20,659
Oh.

48
00:03:21,618 --> 00:03:22,814
Nothing.

49
00:03:22,897 --> 00:03:24,197
Sorry.

50
00:03:25,177 --> 00:03:26,477
Could it be that back then,

51
00:03:27,749 --> 00:03:29,594
the way I put it...

52
00:03:29,677 --> 00:03:31,617
Did it come out wrong?

53
00:03:36,857 --> 00:03:40,334
Could you take this to
Department Manager Tabata in Sales?

54
00:03:40,417 --> 00:03:40,929
Sure.

55
00:03:41,012 --> 00:03:42,305
Oh, I'll take it.

56
00:03:43,890 --> 00:03:44,890
Thanks.

57
00:03:50,877 --> 00:03:52,374
Oh, that's a huge help.

58
00:03:52,457 --> 00:03:53,634
Thank you.

59
00:03:53,717 --> 00:03:55,017
Not at all.

60
00:04:00,697 --> 00:04:02,075
Thanks, this will do.

61
00:04:03,317 --> 00:04:05,177
Excuse me, then.

62
00:04:09,117 --> 00:04:10,254
I'm back.

63
00:04:10,337 --> 00:04:11,637
Welcome back.

64
00:04:24,277 --> 00:04:25,808
Whoa, no way!

65
00:04:25,891 --> 00:04:26,774
What's wrong all of a sudden?

66
00:04:26,857 --> 00:04:28,014
Looks like Shirai messed up.

67
00:04:28,097 --> 00:04:30,817
He has a meeting with Kyowa in Tokyo,
but he's in Shizuoka right now.

68
00:04:30,897 --> 00:04:31,614
What?

69
00:04:31,697 --> 00:04:33,194
Did he double-book himself?

70
00:04:33,277 --> 00:04:35,234
Hey, what time's the meeting?

71
00:04:35,317 --> 00:04:36,654
At 2:00 p.m.

72
00:04:36,737 --> 00:04:37,554
It's fine.

73
00:04:37,637 --> 00:04:38,570
I'll cover for him.

74
00:04:38,653 --> 00:04:40,734
Wait, you just got back.

75
00:04:40,817 --> 00:04:41,674
No problem.

76
00:04:41,757 --> 00:04:43,554
I worked on the Kyowa account before, too.

77
00:04:43,637 --> 00:04:45,313
Tell Shirai to send me
the files and outline.

78
00:04:45,337 --> 00:04:46,114
Got it.

79
00:04:46,197 --> 00:04:47,497
Heading out, then.

80
00:04:48,538 --> 00:04:50,294
Kanda-san is incredible.

81
00:04:50,377 --> 00:04:54,837
He's swamped with his own projects.
How does he make it look so easy?

82
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:57,534
Hello, thank you for
your continued support.

83
00:04:57,617 --> 00:04:59,397
This is Kanda from Chikubeni.

84
00:05:00,277 --> 00:05:02,017
Yes, it's been a while.

85
00:06:03,700 --> 00:06:06,227
You Should Be The One To Come Kiss Me.

86
00:06:07,450 --> 00:06:08,952
(Episode 6)

87
00:06:09,035 --> 00:06:12,038
(Good work today.)

88
00:06:22,007 --> 00:06:24,968
(You haven't come by lately.)

89
00:06:45,697 --> 00:06:47,097
Listen, Kanda...

90
00:06:48,742 --> 00:06:50,243
What?

91
00:06:51,457 --> 00:06:54,457
You didn't forget I told
you I'm gay, did you?

92
00:06:57,197 --> 00:06:59,461
If you sleep over too often,

93
00:06:59,544 --> 00:07:00,837
it puts me in a tough spot.

94
00:07:03,477 --> 00:07:04,594
Huh?

95
00:07:04,677 --> 00:07:05,977
Sorry.

96
00:07:17,479 --> 00:07:18,813
You know,

97
00:07:20,077 --> 00:07:22,217
it's not quite insomnia,

98
00:07:23,068 --> 00:07:25,086
but I've never slept very well.

99
00:07:31,297 --> 00:07:33,997
Somehow, I sleep great at Ueno's place.

100
00:07:54,099 --> 00:07:55,157
I wonder...

101
00:07:57,257 --> 00:07:58,797
Is that guy getting enough sleep?

102
00:08:23,237 --> 00:08:25,014
I'm heading home for the day.

103
00:08:25,097 --> 00:08:27,157
Yeah, good work today.

104
00:08:39,144 --> 00:08:40,478
Actually, maybe I should...

105
00:08:41,020 --> 00:08:42,354
Stay and help out?

106
00:08:42,437 --> 00:08:43,674
Huh?

107
00:08:43,757 --> 00:08:44,757
Don't worry about it.

108
00:08:44,817 --> 00:08:46,253
Careful you don't go
over your overtime limit.

109
00:08:46,277 --> 00:08:49,334
I should be telling you that.

110
00:08:49,417 --> 00:08:50,874
Kanda-san,

111
00:08:50,957 --> 00:08:52,937
aren't you taking on work
that isn't even yours?

112
00:08:54,017 --> 00:08:56,177
Teamwork is everyone's work, right?

113
00:08:57,245 --> 00:08:59,080
You really are a workaholic.

114
00:09:03,077 --> 00:09:04,377
Well, it's more like...

115
00:09:04,937 --> 00:09:08,340
I have nothing to do home alone anyway.

116
00:09:08,423 --> 00:09:09,716
I'm just killing time.

117
00:09:10,617 --> 00:09:12,014
Huh?

118
00:09:12,097 --> 00:09:14,517
If it helps everyone out too,
isn't it a win-win?

119
00:09:19,837 --> 00:09:21,137
Oh, speaking of which,

120
00:09:22,497 --> 00:09:24,137
Ueno-san hasn't stopped by lately.

121
00:09:26,857 --> 00:09:28,157
Yeah.

122
00:09:29,857 --> 00:09:32,077
Because I double- and
triple-check everything now.

123
00:09:34,717 --> 00:09:36,017
Oh, right.

124
00:09:36,517 --> 00:09:40,057
Might as well log my expenses
from that business trip while I'm at it.

125
00:09:50,017 --> 00:09:51,466
Let me handle that.

126
00:09:51,549 --> 00:09:53,414
Wait, I can't ask you to do that.

127
00:09:53,497 --> 00:09:55,257
I'll head out right after I finish this.

128
00:09:55,917 --> 00:09:57,777
You should head home early too, Kanda-san.

129
00:10:02,777 --> 00:10:04,077
Thanks.

130
00:10:04,617 --> 00:10:05,917
Sure thing.

131
00:10:09,397 --> 00:10:11,677
Didn't we agree to stay out of it?

132
00:10:12,957 --> 00:10:14,614
Yeah, well, Kanda-san

133
00:10:14,697 --> 00:10:18,368
isn't just working late.
I think he's taking work home, too.

134
00:10:19,661 --> 00:10:21,412
Something's obviously...

135
00:10:24,217 --> 00:10:25,817
Are you sure you want to put that there?

136
00:10:26,157 --> 00:10:27,457
Huh?

137
00:10:29,477 --> 00:10:30,777
Ah!

138
00:10:32,132 --> 00:10:33,314
Wait, let me take that back.

139
00:10:33,397 --> 00:10:35,037
No take-backs.

140
00:10:36,010 --> 00:10:37,470
(You Lose)

141
00:10:38,177 --> 00:10:39,554
One more game.

142
00:10:39,637 --> 00:10:41,117
Lunch break's almost over.

143
00:10:42,117 --> 00:10:43,935
Darn it...

144
00:10:46,677 --> 00:10:48,137
Good game.

145
00:10:48,817 --> 00:10:51,097
You just came here for
an easy win, didn't you?

146
00:10:51,617 --> 00:10:52,997
No, not at all.

147
00:10:54,737 --> 00:10:56,072
So...

148
00:10:56,573 --> 00:10:58,283
About Kanda-san...

149
00:11:01,177 --> 00:11:03,217
All we can do is quietly
watch over him, right?

150
00:11:03,955 --> 00:11:06,957
Kanda might not even
realize it himself yet.

151
00:11:10,997 --> 00:11:12,694
Or maybe...

152
00:11:12,777 --> 00:11:14,457
Should we give them a little push instead?

153
00:11:15,697 --> 00:11:16,997
Nah.

154
00:11:17,635 --> 00:11:18,970
I'm

155
00:11:19,557 --> 00:11:20,954
a pacifist.

156
00:11:21,037 --> 00:11:22,337
See you later.

157
00:11:27,395 --> 00:11:31,077
If you're a pacifist, at
least let me win once!

158
00:11:36,197 --> 00:11:37,997
That being said,

159
00:11:39,032 --> 00:11:42,051
it's not like I'm not worried...

160
00:11:46,297 --> 00:11:47,654
Mizoguchi.

161
00:11:47,737 --> 00:11:49,037
Need something?

162
00:11:52,962 --> 00:11:54,434
Looking for General Affairs.

163
00:11:54,517 --> 00:11:57,097
The AC on our floor is acting up.

164
00:11:58,317 --> 00:11:59,617
Um...

165
00:12:00,557 --> 00:12:02,097
How has Kanda been lately?

166
00:12:05,157 --> 00:12:06,697
Oh, I mean, uh...

167
00:12:08,817 --> 00:12:13,182
He's seemed really busy lately,
so I wondered if he's holding up okay.

168
00:12:21,115 --> 00:12:24,452
He looks...

169
00:12:24,476 --> 00:12:25,778
awful.

170
00:12:26,717 --> 00:12:29,097
At this rate, he's going to collapse.

171
00:13:07,203 --> 00:13:08,817
Good work.

172
00:13:10,748 --> 00:13:12,574
Sure. Can I ask you something?

173
00:13:12,657 --> 00:13:13,754
Excuse me.

174
00:13:13,837 --> 00:13:15,514
I'm here to check the AC.

175
00:13:15,597 --> 00:13:16,894
Right, come on in.

176
00:13:16,977 --> 00:13:19,048
I heard it's leaking...

177
00:13:21,197 --> 00:13:22,780
Shirai, do you know where it is?

178
00:13:22,863 --> 00:13:23,580
Right over here.

179
00:13:23,663 --> 00:13:24,963
Oh, is it?

180
00:13:25,777 --> 00:13:27,074
Thank you for your help.

181
00:13:27,157 --> 00:13:28,457
Excuse me.

182
00:13:41,977 --> 00:13:43,354
Oh, pardon me.

183
00:13:43,437 --> 00:13:44,194
It's this way.

184
00:13:44,277 --> 00:13:45,408
- Huh?
- Over here?

185
00:13:45,491 --> 00:13:46,997
I'm so sorry.

186
00:14:01,674 --> 00:14:02,968
Are you okay?

187
00:14:03,051 --> 00:14:04,052
I'm fine.

188
00:14:05,277 --> 00:14:06,763
So cool...

189
00:14:06,846 --> 00:14:10,394
- Get it together...
- Think about what you did!

190
00:14:10,477 --> 00:14:12,134
I'm terribly sorry.

191
00:14:12,217 --> 00:14:13,517
So sorry about that.

192
00:14:15,337 --> 00:14:16,474
Oh, right.

193
00:14:16,557 --> 00:14:17,754
It's over here.

194
00:14:17,837 --> 00:14:18,554
Excuse me.

195
00:14:18,637 --> 00:14:20,068
The leak is right over here.

196
00:14:20,151 --> 00:14:21,393
- Excuse me.
- Sorry for all the trouble.

197
00:14:21,417 --> 00:14:22,334
I'll show you the way.

198
00:14:22,417 --> 00:14:23,717
Pardon me.

199
00:14:24,489 --> 00:14:25,782
Sorry...

200
00:14:26,677 --> 00:14:27,977
Just now, I...

201
00:14:28,618 --> 00:14:29,994
I spaced out, too.

202
00:14:35,917 --> 00:14:37,217
Um...

203
00:14:39,504 --> 00:14:40,839
Do you have a minute...

204
00:14:40,922 --> 00:14:42,215
to talk in a bit?

205
00:14:57,277 --> 00:14:58,394
Here.

206
00:14:58,477 --> 00:14:59,777
A peace offering.

207
00:15:04,317 --> 00:15:05,474
Huh?

208
00:15:05,557 --> 00:15:06,857
You like this, right?

209
00:15:08,950 --> 00:15:10,243
Yeah.

210
00:15:17,017 --> 00:15:18,457
Were you okay earlier?

211
00:15:19,057 --> 00:15:20,357
Really sorry about that.

212
00:15:21,177 --> 00:15:22,477
Yeah.

213
00:15:23,172 --> 00:15:24,465
It's nothing.

214
00:15:25,117 --> 00:15:26,517
Don't worry about that.

215
00:15:38,337 --> 00:15:39,637
So...

216
00:15:40,523 --> 00:15:41,816
What did you want to talk about?

217
00:15:44,097 --> 00:15:45,397
Well...

218
00:15:50,377 --> 00:15:52,452
I wanted to know if you're sleeping okay.

219
00:15:52,535 --> 00:15:53,828
I'm fine.

220
00:15:54,328 --> 00:15:55,621
- Really?
- Yeah.

221
00:15:56,497 --> 00:15:58,814
You look exhausted.

222
00:15:58,897 --> 00:16:00,834
This is totally normal for me.

223
00:16:00,917 --> 00:16:02,217
I'm used to it.

224
00:16:09,517 --> 00:16:11,317
Come on, is that all you wanted to say?

225
00:16:15,677 --> 00:16:17,037
Thanks for worrying about me.

226
00:16:21,017 --> 00:16:22,317
Well...

227
00:16:22,917 --> 00:16:24,217
I'm heading back.

228
00:16:26,611 --> 00:16:27,904
Wait!

229
00:16:34,243 --> 00:16:35,634
This...

230
00:16:35,717 --> 00:16:37,238
You left it at my place, right?

231
00:16:40,416 --> 00:16:43,920
It wasn't cheap. Take it home properly.

232
00:16:44,557 --> 00:16:46,337
Besides, look,

233
00:16:47,237 --> 00:16:50,897
there's still the pot,
your clothes, and stuff...

234
00:16:54,555 --> 00:16:56,098
You can come over anytime.

235
00:16:56,974 --> 00:16:58,253
I can lend you the spare key again, too.

236
00:16:58,277 --> 00:16:59,577
No, thanks...

237
00:17:01,197 --> 00:17:02,054
Huh?

238
00:17:02,137 --> 00:17:03,437
Uh, I mean...

239
00:17:06,877 --> 00:17:08,897
I don't need them anymore. Just toss them.

240
00:17:09,397 --> 00:17:10,697
Or sell them if you want.

241
00:17:13,536 --> 00:17:14,996
Toss them?

242
00:17:17,857 --> 00:17:19,977
If you use them, just come take them back!

243
00:17:22,177 --> 00:17:22,894
Hey...

244
00:17:22,977 --> 00:17:24,497
I told you, I don't need them anymore!

245
00:17:28,997 --> 00:17:30,297
Oh...

246
00:17:32,177 --> 00:17:33,477
Sorry...

247
00:17:36,037 --> 00:17:37,823
Anyway, just keep that.

248
00:18:56,844 --> 00:19:02,077
I wanted to keep watching him
feel comfortable right by my side.

249
00:19:03,957 --> 00:19:06,177
That's why I was scared to fall for him.

250
00:19:08,648 --> 00:19:10,040
Because then I'd start...

251
00:19:11,157 --> 00:19:13,177
wanting him to fall for me, too.

252
00:19:16,297 --> 00:19:17,994
Huh?

253
00:19:18,077 --> 00:19:19,377
Really?

254
00:19:21,917 --> 00:19:23,877
Sorry for keeping it from you.

255
00:19:26,157 --> 00:19:28,617
No, I'm sorry for dragging
you to mixers so often.

256
00:19:30,037 --> 00:19:32,772
Whenever you're there, Ueno,
the girls get way more excited...

257
00:19:34,377 --> 00:19:36,237
Oh, that's beside the point right now.

258
00:19:37,037 --> 00:19:39,937
Anyway, if I ever did anything insensitive,
I'm really sorry.

259
00:19:40,497 --> 00:19:41,797
Not at all.

260
00:19:42,377 --> 00:19:44,117
I didn't mind that at all...

261
00:19:46,417 --> 00:19:47,717
So that's how it is.

262
00:19:48,537 --> 00:19:49,837
Oh...

263
00:19:51,437 --> 00:19:52,937
Thanks for telling me.

264
00:19:53,737 --> 00:19:55,037
Yeah.

265
00:20:03,160 --> 00:20:04,554
Ueno!

266
00:20:04,637 --> 00:20:05,894
Hey.

267
00:20:05,977 --> 00:20:07,377
Wanna grab a drink today?

268
00:20:11,797 --> 00:20:12,514
Yeah.

269
00:20:12,597 --> 00:20:13,897
Sure.

270
00:20:16,966 --> 00:20:17,983
So,

271
00:20:18,757 --> 00:20:21,097
don't touch me so casually...

272
00:20:22,497 --> 00:20:23,877
What do you mean, touch you?

273
00:20:26,016 --> 00:20:27,576
I'm serious.

274
00:20:29,186 --> 00:20:32,189
Because it makes me start
thinking of you that way...

275
00:20:33,517 --> 00:20:35,337
I hope you can at least understand that.

276
00:20:37,357 --> 00:20:38,657
Wait a second...

277
00:20:39,277 --> 00:20:40,817
Are you confessing to me?

278
00:20:42,117 --> 00:20:43,417
No.

279
00:20:44,993 --> 00:20:46,293
It's...

280
00:20:47,173 --> 00:20:48,513
It's just...

281
00:20:55,377 --> 00:20:56,677
Listen,

282
00:20:57,317 --> 00:21:00,237
I've never thought about dating a guy,

283
00:21:02,117 --> 00:21:04,597
but if it's with you, Ueno,
I feel like I could give it a shot.

284
00:21:07,413 --> 00:21:08,713
Huh?

285
00:21:10,717 --> 00:21:12,117
Wanna try going out?

286
00:21:34,600 --> 00:21:38,600
(Fujisawa Shuma)

287
00:21:45,012 --> 00:21:46,514
(Busy with your part-time job?)

288
00:21:49,475 --> 00:21:51,101
(Text me back.)

289
00:22:02,097 --> 00:22:03,697
Because you're such an important friend,

290
00:22:05,877 --> 00:22:07,877
at first, I wanted to
return your feelings...

291
00:22:10,097 --> 00:22:11,837
Once we started dating, though,

292
00:22:12,717 --> 00:22:14,857
the way you looked at
me seemed to change...

293
00:22:17,037 --> 00:22:18,337
As a guy,

294
00:22:19,577 --> 00:22:21,217
I started finding you scary.

295
00:22:28,857 --> 00:22:30,237
Once I fall in love,

296
00:22:31,157 --> 00:22:32,457
we can never go back to being

297
00:22:33,517 --> 00:22:35,057
just good friends.

298
00:22:39,357 --> 00:22:42,237
He'll also see the unpleasant side of me.

299
00:22:45,077 --> 00:22:47,837
He's the kind of person you want to
know deeper the more you know him.

300
00:22:49,777 --> 00:22:51,617
I want to know Kanda better.

301
00:22:54,337 --> 00:22:55,637
I'm so happy!

302
00:22:56,697 --> 00:22:58,573
Why are you taking over
my shelf without asking?

303
00:22:58,597 --> 00:23:00,214
Who cares? It was empty anyway.

304
00:23:00,297 --> 00:23:01,934
I'm particular about my layout, okay?

305
00:23:02,017 --> 00:23:03,974
Don't be so stingy.

306
00:23:04,057 --> 00:23:05,357
And I want him

307
00:23:06,051 --> 00:23:07,094
to know me better, too.

308
00:23:12,308 --> 00:23:13,309
Still...

309
00:23:15,937 --> 00:23:18,337
I'm still scared.

310
00:23:44,506 --> 00:23:48,325
(Kanda)

311
00:23:59,772 --> 00:24:03,442
(Next Episode Preview)
Ueno probably hates the way I am right now.

312
00:24:03,525 --> 00:24:04,654
Wait, Kanda!

313
00:24:04,737 --> 00:24:07,114
I confessed to you, and you rejected me.

314
00:24:07,197 --> 00:24:08,353
Kanda, you're straight, right?

315
00:24:08,377 --> 00:24:10,394
You've never liked a guy before, right?

316
00:24:10,477 --> 00:24:13,535
If you choose someone else, I won't
be able to stay by your side smiling.
